# LASP SSW rerun/random-walk example derived from the repository's audited
# Li10M7P8S32/rerun/run/11113 input shape. Replace potential/DFT setup and
# auxiliary files with those for your own licensed LASP case.
potential vasp
explore_type ssw
Run_type 5
SSW.SSWsteps 6
SSW.MaxOptstep 300
SSW.mdfreq 3
MD.initial_T 500
MD.target_T 800
MD.ttotal 4000
MD.dt 2
MD.print_strfreq 250
SSW.LowTemp 600
SSW.HighTemp 800
SSW.TempCycle 3
